Another tool to to create prismatic solid shapes is provided by the external [[Image:Sheetmetal_workbench_icon.svg|16px]] [[SheetMetal_Workbench|SheetMetal]] workbench: [[Image:SheetMetal_AddBase.svg|16px]] [[SheetMetal_AddBase|Make Base Wall]] creates planar objects (blanks) from closed contours and unfoldable bend objects from open contours.
</div>

